  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **I Needed it Most**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 9 archived performances [3]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Nashville to Kentucky, Just Because I Do [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2001-03-17.KVRX_Radio** (recommended): pre-FM broadcast master; 7 songs; 36 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]. Said about its sound: The artist delivered some of the most heartfelt songs ever heard [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Jim James performed seated inside the old health center's radiology room [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2001-03-17.KVRX_Radio**: source: Pre-FM > CD [1]. Also: Erik Wofford handled both the recording engineering and booking agent duties [2]",
